[36,52,73,63,42,74],"title":-1,"rank":"9","loyalty":"0","reputation":"0","equipment":{"weapon":"WP1007102","armor":"WP1013605","helmet":"WP1025605"},"couple":[]},{"story":{"id":"S10515","name":{"zh":"高平陵之变","en":"Incident at Gaoping Tombs"},"year":"249","month":"1"},"faction":null,"city":"CS1007","noRecruit":false,"reject":null,"state":"3","role":0,"stats":[36,52,73,63,42,74],"title":-1,"rank":"9","loyalty":"0","reputation":"0","equipment":{"weapon":"WP1007102","armor":"WP1013605","helmet":"WP1025605"},"couple":[]},{"story":{"id":"S11315","name":{"zh":"西陵之战","en":"Battle of Xiling"},"year":"272","month":"1"},"faction":null,"city":"CS1007","noRecruit":false,"reject":null,"state":"3","role":0,"stats":[36,52,73,63,42,74],"title":-1,"rank":"9","loyalty":"100","reputation":"4350","equipment":{"weapon":"WP1007102","armor":"WP1013605","helmet":"WP1025605"},"couple":[]},{"story":{"id":"S10108","name":{"zh":"英雄集结","en":"A Gathering of Heroes"},"year":"300","month":"3"},"faction":"WJ10065","city":"CS1007","noRecruit":false,"reject":null,"state":"2","role":0,"stats":[36,52,73,63,42,74],"title":-1,"rank":"9","loyalty":"100","reputation":"4350","equipment":{"weapon":"WP1007102","armor":"WP1013605","helmet":"WP1025605"},"couple":[]}],"storyEvents":[],"biography":{"zh":"公孙瓒的幕僚，曾任长史。深得公孙瓒器重，但目光短浅，只懂得巴结奉承，阻止了公孙瓒从背后袭击袁绍的计策。公孙瓒被袁绍击败身死后，关靖叹恨道：“之前若不阻止将军行动，未必不能成功。君子使他人陷于危难之际，必当生死与共，吾等岂可以独存”，随即率军杀入袁绍军中，战死。","tc":"公孫瓚的幕僚，曾任長史。深得公孫瓚器重，但目光短淺，只懂得巴結奉承，阻止了公孫瓚從背后襲擊袁紹的計策。公孫瓚被袁紹擊敗身死后，關靖嘆恨道：“之前若不阻止將軍行動，未必不能成功。君子使他人陷于危難之際，必當生死與共，吾等豈可以獨存”，隨即率軍殺入袁紹軍中，戰死。","en":"Adviser to Gongsun Zan who once served as Jnr Secretary. Deeply trusted by Gongsun Zan but narrow in vision, he was skilled only in flattery and sycophancy, and stopped Gongsun Zan's plan to attack Yuan Shao from the rear. After Gongsun Zan was defeated by Yuan Shao and died, Guan Jing lamented with remorse: ‘Had I not stopped the general earlier, he might not have failed. When a gentleman leads another into peril, he must share life and death with him, how could we survive alone?’ He then led his troops in a charge into Yuan Shao's army and died fighting.","jp":"公孫瓚の幕僚で、長史を務めた。公孫瓚に深く重用されたが見識が浅く、迎合や追従を事とし、公孫瓚が袁紹の背後を突こうとした計略を思いとどまらせた。公孫瓚が袁紹に敗れて討たれると、関靖は「先刻、将軍の出撃を止めねば成ったかもしれぬ。君子たる者、人を危難に陥れておきながら、どうして自分一人だけ生き延びられようか」と悔恨し、すぐさま軍を率いて袁紹軍へと突撃し、討ち死にした。","kr":"공손찬의 막료로, 장사를 지냈다. 공손찬의 깊은 신임을 얻었으나 안목이 좁고 아첨에만 능하여, 공손찬이 원소의 배후를 기습하려던 계책을 가로막았다. 공손찬이 원소에게 패하여 목숨을 잃자 관정은 '지난날 장군의 출진을 막지 않았다면 혹 성공했을지도 모른다. 군자가 남을 위태로운 지경에 빠뜨렸다면 마땅히 생사를 함께해야 하거늘, 내 어찌 홀로 살아남을 수 있겠는가!'라고 한탄하고는, 곧바로 군사를 이끌고 원소의 군중으로 돌격하여 전사했다."},"notRecommended":{"type":"0","year":"999","reason":{"zh":"","tc":"","en":"","jp":"","kr":""}},"raw":{"userIndex":"15","id":"WJ10309","remark":"","surname":"关","surnameTc":"關","surnameEn":"Guan","surnameJp":"関","surnameKr":"관","surnameOther":"","name":"靖","nameTc":"靖","nameEn":"Jing","nameJp":"靖","nameKr":"정","nameOther":"","word":"","wordTc":"","wordEn":"","wordJp":"","wordKr":"","wordOther":"","icon":"关靖","power":"WJ10065","rejectPower":"","rejectDuration":"0","ignoreUnRecruit":"0","ignoreUnSelectable":"0","unSelectable":"0","recruit":"1","travel":"0","state":"2","workYear":"184","city":"CS1007","gender":"0","rule":"36","force":"52","wise":"73","politics":"63","charm":"42","will":"74","ruleTalent":"2","forceTalent":"4","wiseTalent":"8","politicsTalent":"6","charmTalent":"3","willTalent":"9","weaponMaster":"16/16/16/16/16/74/21/16","battleAttribute":"1/1/1/1/1/1/1/1","debateAttribute":"1/1/1","warSkill":"","battleSkill":"","debateCard":"","warSoul":"","battleSoul":"","debateSoul":"","warSoulPoint":"1200","battleSoulPoint":"2700","debateSoulPoint":"5300","strategy":"","strategy2":"1001805","professions":"0/0/1/0/0/0/0/2/1/2/0/0/0/0/1/3/2/3/0/2/0/0/0/1","attribute2":"50/50/50/50/50/50","morality":"6","compatible":"43","loyalty":"100","reputation":"4350","evaluate":"2000","title":"","rank":"9","birth":"158","show":"184","death":"199","age":"0","injury":"","deathReason":"1","type":"0","npcTag":"0","npcNum":"1","microSce